<figure>
  

<img src="/assets/media/metacommunity-variability.png" alt="Metacommunity variability figure showing annual and partitioned plankton community signals." />


  
  <figcaption><p>This analysis separates changes in total phytoplankton biomass from changes in community composition, showing that plankton communities can vary in amount and identity in different ways across the shelf.</p>
</figcaption>
  
</figure>

  
    
<figure>
  

<img src="/assets/media/ifcb-topic-modeling.png" alt="IFCB topic-modeling figure showing plankton community structure across depth and latitude." />


  
  <figcaption><p>Topic modeling treats each sample as a mixture of recurring assemblages, offering a way to detect community patterns that are difficult to see when taxa are examined one at a time.</p>
</figcaption>
  
</figure>

  
